		{
			description: [
				"简单的原版风格存储模组。主要添加了一个方块，可将多个箱子连接到1个网络中，并通过终端访问。"
				""
				"If you're familiar with Tom's Simple Storage mod - in this pack it &cwas heavily nerfed&r to encourage use of &3Refined Storage&r system. The range has been decreased to 3 blocks &lin all directions&r from the connector (7x7x7 sphere). This is still a viable storage option though."
			]
